    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15192" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρκτικός</span></b>  (A), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρκτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.2
				</span></i>
			) <i>near the Bear, arctic, northern,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mu.</u>
					392a3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hipparch.
					1.7.6
				</span></i>
			, etc.: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Gem.
				5.10
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κά, τά,</span>
			<i>the northern constellations,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				1.1.21
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερος</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gem.
				14.10
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				1.1.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>connected with the Great Bear,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύναμις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.Par.</u>
					1.1275
				</span></i>
			.</div>
